                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Most of the people who have written poor reviews of this game have not even played for an hour, I have been playing this game for over a decade and I still love it. There are about 20 - 30 players who have been playing as long as I have and there is reason for that. It's a ton of fun, very challenging, competitive, and has a great tight knit community of good people. Its not developed by a corporation with a big budget just a single developer we call Zuperman. The game has its fair share of quirks ands idiosyncrasies but they are easily overlooked compared to the amount of enjoyment we get playing the game. Don't listen to the people who play for less than a half hour, rage quit because they have no skill, and write bad reviews. They haven't given the game a chance",
